         <div type="div1">
            <head>JOHNNY CROW'S PARTY</head>
            <lg>
               <l/>
               <l/>
            </lg>
            <table rend="frame" xml:id="Table2">
               <row>
                  <cell/>
                  <cell role="label">Johnny CrowPlied Rake and Hoe</cell>
               </row>
               <row>
                  <cell/>
                  <cell role="label">And improved his little Garden.</cell>
               </row>
               <row>
                  <cell/>
                  <cell role="label">And the Eagle</cell>
               </row>
               <row>
                  <cell/>
                  <cell role="label">Looked quite regal</cell>
               </row>
               <row>
                  <cell/>
                  <cell role="label">In Johnny Crow's Garden</cell>
               </row>
               <row>
                  <cell/>
                  <cell role="label">And the Cockatoo<lb/>Said "<hi rend="italic">Comment vous portez vous?</hi>"</cell>
               </row>
               <row>
                  <cell/>
                  <cell role="label">And the Gander</cell>
               </row>
               <row>
                  <cell/>
                  <cell role="label">Didn't understand her;</cell>
               </row>
               <row>
                  <cell/>
                  <cell role="label">But the Flamingo<lb/>Talked the same lingo</cell>
               </row>
               <row>
                  <cell/>
                  <cell role="label">In Johnny Crow's Garden.</cell>
               </row>
               <row>
                  <cell/>
                  <cell role="label">And the Bear</cell>
               </row>
               <row>
                  <cell/>
                  <cell role="label">Sang a sentimental Air,</cell>
               </row>
               <row>
                  <cell/>
                  <cell role="label">But the Giraffe<lb/>Was inclined to laugh;</cell>
               </row>
               <row>
                  <cell/>
                  <cell role="label">Even the Duckling<lb/>Couldn't help chuckling<lb/>In Johnny Crow's Garden.</cell>
               </row>
               <row>
                  <cell/>
                  <cell role="label">Then the Snake</cell>
               </row>
               <row>
                  <cell/>
                  <cell role="label">Got entangled with the rake</cell>
               </row>
               <row>
                  <cell/>
                  <cell role="label">In Johnny Crow's Garden.</cell>
               </row>
               <row>
                  <cell/>
                  <cell role="label">And the Cock</cell>
               </row>
               <row>
                  <cell/>
                  <cell role="label">Had a very nasty knock;</cell>
               </row>
               <row>
                  <cell/>
                  <cell role="label">So the Hen<lb/>Said:</cell>
               </row>
               <row>
                  <cell/>
                  <cell role="label">"We'll never come again</cell>
               </row>
               <row>
                  <cell/>
                  <cell role="label">To Johnny Crow's Garden!"</cell>
               </row>
               <row>
                  <cell/>
                  <cell role="label">And the Sheep</cell>
               </row>
               <row>
                  <cell/>
                  <cell role="label">Went to sleep,</cell>
               </row>
               <row>
                  <cell/>
                  <cell role="label">And the Armadillo</cell>
               </row>
               <row>
                  <cell/>
                  <cell role="label">Used him for a pillow;</cell>
               </row>
               <row>
                  <cell/>
                  <cell role="label">And the Porcupine</cell>
               </row>
               <row>
                  <cell/>
                  <cell role="label">Said: "Wake me if for talk you pine!"</cell>
               </row>
               <row>
                  <cell/>
                  <cell role="label">In Johnny Crow's</cell>
               </row>
               <row>
                  <cell/>
                  <cell role="label">Garden.</cell>
               </row>
               <row>
                  <cell/>
                  <cell role="label">And the Kangaroo</cell>
               </row>
               <row>
                  <cell/>
                  <cell role="label">Tried to paint the Roses blue</cell>
               </row>
               <row>
                  <cell/>
                  <cell role="label">Till the Camel<lb/>Swallowed the Enamel.</cell>
               </row>
               <row>
                  <cell/>
                  <cell role="label">And the Reindeer<lb/>Said: "I'm sorry for your pain, dear!"</cell>
               </row>
               <row>
                  <cell/>
                  <cell role="label">In Johnny Crow's Garden.</cell>
               </row>
               <row>
                  <cell/>
                  <cell role="label">So the Chimpanzee<lb/>Put the Kettle on for Tea;</cell>
               </row>
               <row>
                  <cell/>
                  <cell role="label">And the Seal</cell>
               </row>
               <row>
                  <cell/>
                  <cell role="label">Made a very big Meal;</cell>
               </row>
               <row>
                  <cell/>
                  <cell role="label">While the Sole<lb/>Shared a Muffin with the Mole<lb/>In Johnny Crow's Garden.</cell>
               </row>
               <row>
                  <cell/>
                  <cell role="label">Then they picked the Flowers, and<lb/>wandered in the Maze,<lb/>And before they went their several ways</cell>
               </row>
               <row>
                  <cell/>
                  <cell role="label">They all joined together<lb/>In a Hearty Vote of Praise</cell>
               </row>
               <row>
                  <cell/>
                  <cell role="label">Of Johnny Crow and his Garden.</cell>
               </row>
